    <div class=3D"publicBody">
        <h1>Community Guidelines</h1>
        <p>Welcome to the Bfun community! Our goal is to maintain a safe, r=
espectful, and enjoyable experience for all of our valued members. Please r=
ead the following guidelines to ensure a positive experience for everyone.<=
/p>
        <ul>
                        <li>
                <h3>Zero Tolerance for Child Sexual Exploitation and Abuse =
(CSEA)</h3>
                <div>Bfun is dedicated to protecting children and ensuring =
that no content or behavior on our platform endangers them. Any form of Chi=
ld Sexual Exploitation and Abuse (CSEA) is strictly prohibited. This includ=
es, but is not limited to:
                       <ul>
                            <li class=3D"textLi">Child Sexual Abuse Materia=
l (CSAM): Uploading, sharing, storing, or soliciting any content that sexua=
lizes or exploits minors, including visual depictions (photos, videos, illu=
strations), text, or third-party links.</li>
                            <li class=3D"textLi">Sexualized Discussions Inv=
olving Minors: Sharing inappropriate or explicit comments about or directed=
 toward children.</li>
                            <li class=3D"textLi">Child Grooming: Engaging i=
n predatory behavior, such as attempting to befriend minors with the intent=
 of exploitation or abuse.</li>
                            <li class=3D"textLi">Impersonation: Creating ac=
counts impersonating minors or using profiles of children for sexual or exp=
loitative purposes.</li>
                            <li class=3D"textLi textTile">Profile Images In=
volving Children: Photos of children must meet the following standards:</li=
><li class=3D"textLi">Children must be fully clothed.</li><li class=3D"text=
Li">Children cannot appear alone; a parent or guardian must be present in t=
he image.</li><li class=3D"textLi">Photos that include children's genitalia=
 or buttocks, even when partially covered or obscured with emojis, are stri=
ctly forbidden.</li>
                            <li class=3D"textLi textTile">Important: While =
we understand some users may want to share photos of their children appropr=
iately, any discussions or imagery involving minors must remain lawful, rel=
evant, and respectful</li>
                            <li class=3D"textLi textTile">How We Handle Vio=
lations</li>
                            <li class=3D"textLi">Violating this policy will=
 result in immediate account suspension or removal.</li>
                            <li class=3D"textLi">In accordance with U.S. la=
w, any instances of suspected child sexual exploitation, grooming, or abuse=
 that come to our attention will be reported to NCMEC. NCMEC may share thes=
e reports with relevant local, national, or international law enforcement a=
gencies to facilitate further investigation.</li>
                            <li class=3D"textLi">Reports made to NCMEC may =
be shared with local and global law enforcement agencies.</li>
                            <li class=3D"textLi textTile">Reporting Mechani=
sm If you come across any content or behavior violating this policy:</li>
                            <li class=3D"textLi">Use the in-app reporting t=
ools.</li>
                            <li class=3D"textLi">Email our safety team dire=
ctly at support &lt;AT&gt; Bfun.site.</li>
                            <li class=3D"textLi">Your report will be review=
ed urgently, and necessary action will be taken.</li>
                        </ul></div>
            </li>
                        <li>
                <h3>Age Requirements</h3>
                <div>Members must be 19 or older to join our community. Mem=
bers suspected to be under 19 will be banned from the site.</div>
            </li>
                        <li>
                <h3>Bfun Is a Dating Site</h3>
                <div>Our platform is all about finding meaningful relations=
hips. Escorts or prostitutes are banned as it goes against the terms of our=
 Service Agreement.</div>
            </li>
                        <li>
                <h3>Don't Be Abusive</h3>
                <div>Bfun reserves the right to block abusive members.</div=
>
            </li>
                        <li>
                <h3>No Virtual Relationships, Scammers, Frauds or Catfishin=
g</h3>
                <div>Those that mislead other members will be banned and ma=
y face additional legal consequences.</div>
            </li>
                        <li>
                <h3>No Low-Quality Photos</h3>
                <div>We also reserve the right to block low-quality and low=
-effort profiles.</div>
            </li>
                        <li>
                <h3>Honesty and Respect</h3>
                <div>Be truthful in your profile, updates, and interactions=
 with others. Show respect to all members, regardless of their background, =
opinions, or preferences.</div>
            </li>
                        <li>
                <h3>Mutual Consent and Boundaries</h3>
                <div>Make sure all relationships and interactions are conse=
nsual and respect personal boundaries. Avoid pressuring or manipulating oth=
ers into uncomfortable situations.</div>
            </li>
                        <li>
                <h3>No Harassment or Discrimination</h3>
                <div>We strictly prohibit harassment, bullying, or discrimi=
nation. This includes offensive language, threats, hate speech, and derogat=
ory comments. Engaging in such behavior may result in being banned.</div>
            </li>
                        <li>
                <h3>Privacy and Personal Information</h3>
                <div>Respect others' privacy and avoid sharing personal inf=
ormation without consent, including contact details, addresses, or other se=
nsitive info.</div>
            </li>
                        <li>
                <h3>No Spam or Advertising</h3>
                <div>Avoid posting spam, ads, or self-promotional content w=
ithout permission, such as affiliate links, product promotions, or unrelate=
d content to Bfun.</div>
            </li>
                        <li>
                <h3>Appropriate Content</h3>
                <div>Share only relevant and suitable content for the Bfun =
community. Explicit or adult content, such as nudity, explicit language, or=
 graphic imagery, must be shared privately and consensually.</div>
            </li>
                        <li>
                <h3>Report Violations</h3>
                <div>If you come across any violations of these guidelines,=
 kindly report them to us immediately. We'll review and take the necessary =
action.</div>
            </li>
                        <li>
                <h3>Follow the Law</h3>
                <div>Make sure your actions on our platform adhere to all r=
elevant laws and regulations. Illegal activities, such as fraud, extortion,=
 or solicitation, will be reported to the appropriate authorities.</div>
            </li>
                    </ul>
        <p class=3D"lCenter">By participating in our community, you agree t=
o comply with these guidelines. Non-compliance may result in warnings, temp=
orary suspensions, or permanent bans from the platform. We reserve the righ=
t to amend these guidelines as necessary to maintain a safe and enjoyable e=
xperience for all members.</p>
    </div>


